      * a COMBINING accent    "é" = "e" + U+0301 (2 codepoints, 1 grapheme)
      * a multi-codepoint emoji "👨‍👩‍👧" (5 codepoints, 1 grapheme)
      * a flag "🇵🇱" (2 codepoints, 1 grapheme)
